# OneMath — SAT Math Practice Platform

OneMath is a prototype digital learning platform designed for
SAT Math preparation, featuring an interactive question bank
focused on Algebra.

The project explores the design and development of a digital
assessment experience inspired by modern computer-based testing
interfaces, while maintaining an original visual identity and
design.

## 🚀 Live Demo

[Access OneMath](https://onemath-2.vercel.app/)

## 🎯 Objective

The project aims to create an interactive environment for
students preparing for the SAT Math section.

The current prototype focuses on Algebra and serves as a
foundation for expanding the platform into a broader SAT
question bank.

## 📚 Question Bank

The prototype includes a collection of Algebra questions
designed around the types of mathematical skills required for
SAT preparation.

The platform is structured to support the future expansion of
additional mathematical domains and question sets.

## 💻 Assessment Experience

The interface was designed specifically for digital assessment,
taking inspiration from modern computer-based testing platforms.

The project explores:

- Question navigation
- Multiple-choice interactions
- Digital answer selection
- Structured question presentation
- Student-oriented interface design
- Responsive web interaction

The visual design and implementation are original.

## 🧠 Educational Technology

OneMath combines educational methodology with software
development to create a more engaging digital learning
experience.

The project demonstrates the application of technology to:

- Digital assessment
- Test preparation
- Mathematics education
- Interactive learning
- Educational content delivery

